                                "sense_id": "9c61d981-469a-3882-8804-12ca79ecf5fa",
                                "text": "\"My patience must be inexhaustible. I am much tempted to kick you downstairs, Mr. Railing.\" / \"You forget that I'm a working-man and horny-handed, so it's safer not to try.\""
